LAMMPS (29 Aug 2024)
units           metal
dimension       3
boundary        s s s
atom_style      atomic

# ---------- Fe 晶格 ----------
lattice         bcc 2.855
Lattice spacing in x,y,z = 2.855 2.855 2.855
region          whole block -60 60 -60 60 -40 100 units box
create_box      1 whole
Created orthogonal box = (-60 -60 -40) to (60 60 100)
  2 by 2 by 4 MPI processor grid

# ---------- 定义几何参数 ----------
variable        R equal 25.0
variable        H equal 60.0

# ---------- 半球 ----------
# 球心在 (0,0,0)，取 z <= 0 部分
region          sphere_all sphere 0.0 0.0 0.0 ${R} units box
region          sphere_all sphere 0.0 0.0 0.0 25 units box
region          hemi block -100 100 -100 100 -${R} 0 units box
region          hemi block -100 100 -100 100 -25 0 units box
region          hemisphere intersect 2 sphere_all hemi

# ---------- 圆柱 ----------
region          cylinder_part cylinder z 0.0 0.0 ${R} 0 ${H} units box
region          cylinder_part cylinder z 0.0 0.0 25 0 ${H} units box
region          cylinder_part cylinder z 0.0 0.0 25 0 60 units box

# ---------- 合并区域 ----------
region          indenter union 2 hemisphere cylinder_part

# ---------- 填充原子 ----------
create_atoms    1 region indenter
Created 13190 atoms
  using lattice units in orthogonal box = (-60.012 -60.012 -40.014) to (60.012 60.012 100.014)
  create_atoms CPU = 0.001 seconds

mass            1 55.845

write_data      indenter.data
System init for write_data ...
